docs {
  # ClassroomService.SaveItem

  `/ltedu.classroom.v1.ClassroomService/SaveItem` · unary · `ltedu/classroom/v1/classroom.proto`

  ## Request — `SaveItemRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `item` | `Item` | Empty id creates it at the end of unit_id |

  ## Response — `SaveItemResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `item` | `Item` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Item`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `unit_id` | `string` |  |
  | `kind` | `string` | reading \| file \| video \| link \| live \| activity \| quiz \| task \| forum |
  | `title` | `string` |  |
  | `body` | `string` |  |
  | `url` | `string` |  |
  | `complementary` | `bool` |  |
  | `starts_at` | `string` | live only: RFC 3339 start and length |
  | `duration_minutes` | `optional int32` |  |
  | `recording_url` | `string` |  |
  | `library_item_id` | `string` | Taken from the library: body, url and files come from there |
  | `published` | `bool` |  |
  | `files` | `int32` |  |
  | `viewed` | `bool` | For a student: whether they opened it. For staff: how many students did |
  | `views` | `int32` |  |
  | `provider` | `string` | live only: platform (video inside ListerCore Edu) \| meet (url is the external link). Empty: meet |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
